    "updated_at": "2025-05-15T07:42:21Z",
    "body": "I fixed a bunch of this in WebKit some years ago and added better helpers. There's still some things to be fixed, but I'm not in favor of changing this definition at this point. If anything it's already too wide.\n\nJavaScript is not a good place to borrow from as for some inexplicable reason they use Unicode's definition of White Space, which changes over time. That's absolutely not what we'd want.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
